# U2 fail/sema fixture: channels carry value types only. A refcounted heap
# element type (string/Array/Buffer/struct) is rejected by Sema in ALL build
# modes with a located error — the byte-copy channel transport cannot own a
# reference-counted element. (reject, don't coerce/crash/leak)
^[^:]+\.b:[0-9]+:[0-9]+: error: channel element type '[A-Za-z_<>0-9 ]+' is not supported: channels carry value types only
